{"event": "LIFE_CYCLE_FAILED", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T13:42:33.341148+00:00", "cycle": 20, "goal_id": "integration", "error": "IAO_ALL_PROVIDERS_FAILED: ovh-anonymous:TimeoutError, llm7-anonymous:HTTPError", "traceback": "Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/data/data/com.termux/files/home/so-omega-prime/omega/life_core.py\", line 261, in run_cycle\n  File \"/data/data/com.termux/files/home/so-omega-prime/omega/life_core.py\", line 222, in invoke_padge\n    memory[\"history\"] = memory[\"history\"][-100:]\n         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/data/data/com.termux/files/home/so-omega-prime/omega/padge.py\", line 368, in ask_iao\n    result = chat_with_metadata([\n        {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": prompt}\n    ], timeout=90)\n  File \"/data/data/com.termux/files/home/so-omega-prime/omega/llm_router.py\", line 180, in chat_with_metadata\n    raise RuntimeError(\"IAO_ALL_PROVIDERS_FAILED: \" + \", \".join(errors))\nRuntimeError: IAO_ALL_PROVIDERS_FAILED: ovh-anonymous:TimeoutError, llm7-anonymous:HTTPError\n"}
